    <!-- https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/CategoryDefinition_2122a081 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/CategoryDefinition_2122a081">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#NormativeTargetCategoryDefinition"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#PolicyTargetCategoryStatement"/>
        <cdsg:appliesInJurisdiction rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/NationalJurisdiction_22402ee6"/>
        <cdsg:definesTargetCategory rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/target/source/category-2122a081"/>
        <cdsg:hasSourceEvidence rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/evidence/SourceEvidence_45f5130b"/>
        <cdsg:isExpressedIn rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/Statute_fc595eef"/>
        <cdsg:sourceStatementText xml:lang="ko">2. “결혼이민자등”이란 다문화가족의 구성원으로서 다음 각 목의 어느 하나에 해당하는 자를 말한다. 가. 「재한외국인 처우 기본법」 제2조제3호의 결혼이민자 나. 「국적법」 제4조에 따라 귀화허가를 받은 자 3. “아동ㆍ청소년”이란 24세 이하인 사람을 말한다.</cdsg:sourceStatementText>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Definition of marriage immigrant and related persons, Multicultural Families Support Act art. 2(2)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">다문화가족지원법 제2조제2호 결혼이민자등 정의</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/CategoryDefinition_b17f3313 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/CategoryDefinition_b17f3313">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#PolicyTargetCategoryStatement"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#TargetCategoryConstitutionRule"/>
        <cdsg:appliesInJurisdiction rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/NationalJurisdiction_22402ee6"/>
        <cdsg:constitutesTargetCategory rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/target/source/category-b17f3313"/>
        <cdsg:hasSourceEvidence rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/evidence/SourceEvidence_356412d5"/>
        <cdsg:isExpressedIn rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/Statute_9feedf13"/>
        <cdsg:sourceStatementText xml:lang="ko">제4조(귀화에 의한 국적 취득) ① 대한민국 국적을 취득한 사실이 없는 외국인은 법무부장관의 귀화허가(歸化許可)를 받아 대한민국 국적을 취득할 수 있다. ② 법무부장관은 귀화허가 신청을 받으면 제5조부터 제7조까지의 귀화 요건을 갖추었는지를 심사한 후 그 요건을 갖춘 사람에게만 귀화를 허가한다.&lt;개정 2017. 12. 19.&gt;</cdsg:sourceStatementText>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Acquisition of nationality by naturalization, Nationality Act art. 4</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">국적법 제4조 귀화에 의한 국적 취득</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/CategoryDefinition_b6df36bc -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/CategoryDefinition_b6df36bc">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#NormativeTargetCategoryDefinition"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#PolicyTargetCategoryStatement"/>
        <cdsg:appliesInJurisdiction rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/NationalJurisdiction_22402ee6"/>
        <cdsg:definesTargetCategory rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/target/source/category-b6df36bc"/>
        <cdsg:hasSourceEvidence rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/evidence/SourceEvidence_0f99c144"/>
        <cdsg:isExpressedIn rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/Statute_fc595eef"/>
        <cdsg:sourceStatementText xml:lang="ko">3. “아동ㆍ청소년”이란 24세 이하인 사람을 말한다.</cdsg:sourceStatementText>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Definition of child or youth, Multicultural Families Support Act art. 2(3)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">다문화가족지원법 제2조제3호 아동청소년 정의</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/CategoryDefinition_e836684f -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/CategoryDefinition_e836684f">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#NormativeTargetCategoryDefinition"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#PolicyTargetCategoryStatement"/>
        <cdsg:appliesInJurisdiction rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/NationalJurisdiction_22402ee6"/>
        <cdsg:definesTargetCategory rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/target/source/category-e836684f"/>
        <cdsg:hasSourceEvidence rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/evidence/SourceEvidence_c7af388d"/>
        <cdsg:isExpressedIn rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/Statute_fc595eef"/>
        <cdsg:sourceStatementText xml:lang="ko">1. “다문화가족”이란 다음 각 목의 어느 하나에 해당하는 가족을 말한다. 가. 「재한외국인 처우 기본법」 제2조제3호의 결혼이민자와 「국적법」 제2조부터 제4조까지의 규정에 따라 대한 민국 국적을 취득한 자로 이루어진 가족 나. 「국적법」 제3조 및 제4조에 따라 대한민국 국적을 취득한 자와 같은 법 제2조부터 제4조까지의 규정에 따라 대한민국 국적을 취득한 자로 이루어진 가족</cdsg:sourceStatementText>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Definition of multicultural family, Multicultural Families Support Act art. 2(1)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">다문화가족지원법 제2조제1호 다문화가족 정의</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/CategoryDefinition_f229de55 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/CategoryDefinition_f229de55">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#PolicyTargetCategoryStatement"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/core#TargetCategoryConstitutionRule"/>
        <cdsg:appliesInJurisdiction rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/NationalJurisdiction_22402ee6"/>
        <cdsg:constitutesTargetCategory rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/target/source/category-f229de55"/>
        <cdsg:hasSourceEvidence rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/evidence/SourceEvidence_8557e9f0"/>
        <cdsg:isExpressedIn rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/kr/Statute_9feedf13"/>
        <cdsg:sourceStatementText xml:lang="ko">제2조(출생에 의한 국적 취득) ① 다음 각 호의 어느 하나에 해당하는 자는 출생과 동시에 대한민국 국적(國籍)을 취득 한다. 1. 출생 당시에 부(父)또는 모(母)가 대한민국의 국민인 자 2. 출생하기 전에 부가 사망한 경우에는 그 사망 당시에 부가 대한민국의 국민이었던 자 3. 부모가 모두 분명하지 아니한 경우나 국적이 없는 경우에는 대한민국에서 출생한 자</cdsg:sourceStatementText>
